# The 9front layer the demo page's ?linux mode puts at /9 (src/web/index.html):
# the paths, relative to the arm64 slim root `zig build slim -Darch=arm64`
# makes (design/0064-multicall.md), that `zig build web` packs into
# zig-out/web/nine-arm64.h9a. It's the machine's 9front root, so a Linux
# program has /9/bin/rc and /9/bin/wsmount (MANUAL.md, "Try it"). The
# commands are links to 9box, which tools/webroot.zig stores once.

arm64
rc
adm
bin/
dev/
env/
fd/
mnt/term/cwd/
n/
net/
proc/
srv/
tmp/
